        "node_id": "n_11_5acc87",
        "thought_text": "Since there are only 3 tasks, enumerate all 3! = 6 possible permutations of completion order, calculate the total cost for each, and find the minimum.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "293716036815499522",
